  <title>Shipping carriers</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Administration</gui><gui>Shipping carriers</gui></guiseq>
  lists the carriers, such as UPS or the post office, that can be chosen for a
  contact's <link xref="contacts#shipping">shipping address</link>.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p><gui>New</gui> adds one; click its <gui>Name</gui> to name
    it.</p></item>
    <item><p>Check <gui>Default</gui> on the carrier new addresses start
    with.</p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Delete</gui> deletes the selected carrier; if addresses still
    use it, you are asked which carrier to move them to, then click
    <gui>Update and Delete</gui>.</p></item>
  </list>

</page>
